#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_House4/scripts.inc:12
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_House4_Text_MysteriesAtBottomOfSea"
msgid ""
"This planet's biggest mysteries are\n"
"at the bottom of the sea.\p"
"Somebody said that, but I don't know…$"
msgstr ""
"这个星球最大的谜团\n"
"就在海底。\p"
"有人这么说过，不过我也不知道……$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_House4/scripts.inc:17
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_House4_Text_UnderwaterTrenchMossdeepSootopolis"
msgid ""
"There's a deep underwater trench\n"
"between MOSSDEEP and SOOTOPOLIS.\p"
"That's what someone told me, anyway.$"
msgstr ""
"在绿岭市和琉璃市之间\n"
"有一条很深的海沟。\p"
"反正，别人是这么告诉我的。$"
